M1 killed: alone: worst at or under the threshold
M2 killed: alone: at least 5 observations
M3 killed: alone: every observation passed
M4 killed: alone: a hook is held to its own threshold
M5 killed: full: a test's own line at or under the threshold
M6 killed: full: a test's own line is a pass
M7 killed: full: no line bounds nothing in a file with a failure
M8 killed: full: a hook's file time less its tests at or under the threshold
M9 killed: full: a file missing from a run bounds nothing
C1 control held: control: an alone worst exactly at the threshold holds
M10 killed: later: an observation past the threshold refutes the removal
C2 control held: control: a hook's file time less its tests exactly at the threshold holds
C3 control held: control: a later observation exactly at the threshold holds
10 of 10 killed, 3 of 3 controls held
